OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsked about the findings, Labour chair
OL,8,FBridget Phillipson says families should
OL,9,Fbe supported "earlier" and there needs
OL,10,Fto be "better access to mental health
OL,11,Fservices" in local communities and
OL,12,Fschools
OL,14,FErin, now 21, says being diagnosed as
OL,15,Fautistic at college helped her know
OL,16,Fwhat support she needed: "I could know
OL,17,Fexactly what I wanted to say, but I
OL,18,Fphysically couldn't get the words out"
